          "git_sha": "ca7fde7968c2f9824e74441a078457db15e19a77",
          "line_end": 81,
          "line_start": 74,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "jo-inc/pi-mem",
          "url": "https://github.com/jo-inc/pi-mem/blob/ffb706b8805d64e04919ceff4c82084a67504e5d/README.md#L74-L81"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1833fef75eb97e2f7b96f0f311abb12e9ec6100dcfa688e39ea9721f6d686021",
        "slc_370d24c26b1453ae9d8e7794929036e237e8a59ac0c33ac8789bfa049a13b166"
      ],
      "text": "Memory files live under ~/.pi/agent/memory/ by default, overridable via the PI_MEMORY_DIR environment variable."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_620008029b840c2f25863d3d1c3c672a238390191135ad0196dacae85337a154",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ffb706b8805d64e04919ceff4c82084a67504e5d",
          "git_sha": "ca7fde7968c2f9824e74441a078457db15e19a77",
          "line_end": 30,
          "line_start": 25,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "jo-inc/pi-mem",
          "url": "https://github.com/jo-inc/pi-mem/blob/ffb706b8805d64e04919ceff4c82084a67504e5d/README.md#L25-L30"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_08f188128254c6cb17bc85a26cf4d9c2b8c224a2b1fe0234b30cba3ef6c259f7"
      ],
      "text": "The memory layout includes MEMORY.md (curated long-term memory), SCRATCHPAD.md (checklist), daily/YYYY-MM-DD.md append-only logs, and LLM-created notes/*.md files."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_35cbb63a9e2dd4fa78dec510a42a690cd88eb139e0f87a0c57a4d2680307596e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ffb706b8805d64e04919ceff4c82084a67504e5d",
          "git_sha": "ca7fde7968c2f9824e74441a078457db15e19a77",
          "line_end": 41,
          "line_start": 36,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "jo-inc/pi-mem",
          "url": "https://github.com/jo-inc/pi-mem/blob/ffb706b8805d64e04919ceff4c82084a67504e5d/README.md#L36-L41"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6ac079b951e200b7c9e4c2aacdb316e9f80b6e85e102228c4856b0b19494b723"
      ],
      "text": "Exposes tools memory_write (long_term/daily/note targets with append and overwrite modes), memory_read (long_term, scratchpad, daily, note, file, list), memory_search, and a scratchpad checklist tool."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f88027b7f1be01fe37654700cd607e314ad93535b2a4bf063b7c568c268a07f3",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ffb706b8805d64e04919ceff4c82084a67504e5d",
          "git_sha": "ca7fde7968c2f9824e74441a078457db15e19a77",
          "line_end": 41,
          "line_start": 36,
