      ],
      "text": "Configuration is via environment variables or a .pi-mem.json file in the memory directory, with environment variables taking precedence when both are set."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b8e66a000b23991763ca64ecaa7bfb9653601054c36ec2ac57f0621d11cdf58c",
