          "line_end": 89,
          "line_start": 85,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "jo-inc/pi-mem",
          "url": "https://github.com/jo-inc/pi-mem/blob/ffb706b8805d64e04919ceff4c82084a67504e5d/README.md#L85-L89"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_bd9342b652814504ce23b8c3cf2527eca45b6454ebc1c3476a92638202980809"
      ],
      "text": "A dashboard widget shows an auto-generated 'Last 24h' summary at session start and switch, scanning recent session files for titles, costs, and sub-agent counts, grouping topics via an LLM call with a flat-list fallback, rebuilt every 15 minutes in the background, and also showing open scratchpad items."
    },
